usage: governance-ledger [-h]
                         {run,approve,publish,check,list,show,resolve,preview,diff-impact,review-packet,authority-bundle,semantic-commit,compile-authority,execution-projection,replay-authority,replay-execution,verify-lineage}
                         ...

positional arguments:
  {run,approve,publish,check,list,show,resolve,preview,diff-impact,review-packet,authority-bundle,semantic-commit,compile-authority,execution-projection,replay-authority,replay-execution,verify-lineage}
    run                 generate draft governance artifacts
    approve             approve a review artifact
    publish             publish an approved review
    check               check generated validation artifacts
    list                list governance registry artifacts
    show                show a governance artifact
    resolve             resolve an explicit versioned authority reference
    preview             derive governance_impact_preview.v1 from an authority
                        contract
    diff-impact         derive authority_diff_impact.v1 from old and new
                        authority contracts
    review-packet       derive governance_review_packet.v1 from semantic
                        governance artifacts
    authority-bundle    derive authority_bundle.v1 from published governance
                        artifacts
    semantic-commit     freeze completed semantic reconciliation as
                        semantic_commit_bundle.v1
    compile-authority   compile semantic_commit_bundle.v1 into
                        compiled_authority_contract.v1
    execution-projection
                        project runtime requirements from
                        compiled_authority_contract.v1
    replay-authority    replay governance source into compilation report and
                        authority contract
    replay-execution    legacy raw replay (unsupported with Guard 0.19; use
                        SDK/store saved replay)
    verify-lineage      verify authority provenance lineage against an
                        optional compilation report

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
